  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan CAFOD Associate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to support Misereor in employing and hosting the CAFOD Associate for Afghanistan. 

The Afghanistan programme is in a growth phase and the capacity of London-based CAFOD staff to monitor the programme, provide financial oversight and to provide technical accompaniment support, is limited given the challenges of the insecure context.  Given the growth of the programme, and the need for CAFOD to ensure programmatic impact, monitoring and learning, accountability and financial stewardship, it has been identified there is a need to strengthen in-country support to partners.

The specific objectives of the post are to:
&#x2022;	Support partners to strengthen capacities and delivery, based on agreed capacity development plans, particularly for institutional funding (IF) supported projects. High priority areas are project design, MEAL, and financial management.
&#x2022;	Strengthen CAFOD&#x2019;s direct monitoring and financial oversight of the Afghanistan programme.</narrative>
  </description>
